Yes, but it requires two scrolls of genocide.

Blessed genocide = genocide every monster represented by a given
symbol (e.g. 'h')

Uncursed genocide = genocide every monster of a given species
(e.g. 'master mind flayers')

Cursed genocide = summons some number of what you tried to 
genocide.  Do *not* to this with master mind flayers unless you
really really hate your character and like leaving deadly bones
files.

You can also get the equivalent of an uncursed genocide from a 
throne, although this is fairly uncommon.  I seem to get this one
about once every twenty thrones, on average.


